// VarChar(768) fits a single utf8mb4 index. Composite indexes need room for every key.
// Registry keys use 191 chars; band-scoped slugs use 767 chars plus the 4-byte bandId.
// https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/innodb-limits.html

